==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lucky Dags]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Although the Lucky Dags may look threatening, its single target makes it so one can just spam meatshields and DPS units to beat this stage easily.

